{"model": "gpt-6-luna", "qid": "q006", "dataset": "gsm8k", "para": 3, "sample": "g", "temp": 0.0, "answer": "10", "correct": false, "content_len": 255, "reasoning_len": 0, "snippet": "The month has 30 days. In the first 24 days:\n\n- First 8 days: good\n- Second 8 days: bad\n- Third 8 days: neutral\n\nThat's 8 good days so far.\n\nThe next three days are: good, neutral, good — adding 2 more good days.\n\nTotal good days = 8 + 2 = 10.\n\nAnswer: 10", "usage": {"pt": 407, "ct": 92}, "t": 1792301664.1}
